24095.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124095.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #123972\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nPossible regression (3.x ok but >=4.6 reproduced _can reproduce it starting from this commit._)\r\n\r\n* #113859\r\n\r\nSince remove this line  [#L1770](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/d134fcfa4cae722e5403642b5ce07bcc7c7dd78a#diff-b88f0bde58b731e8dd353707c8011fb7a1e452f0db2c9f15f4b7905d60e5e52eL1770), `Save Resource As...` will always kept last scene filename nor the filename of saved resources.\r\n\r\nThe code call `EditorNode::save_resource_as(const Ref<Resource> &p_resource, const String &p_at_path)` without `p_at_path`\r\n\r\n|Case|Before (4.7.2)|After|\r\n| -| -| -|\r\n|[`EditorResourcePicker::_edit_menu_cbk` `OBJ_MENU_SAVE_AS`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7cfa294a0b81bed7986be04a848cc1832a3f083/editor/inspector/editor_resource_picker.cpp#L558)|<img width=\"1639\" height=\"943\" alt=\"image-20261003002853-9zni6q7\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b415e1ab-3d28-41b5-98e0-b2e30fc2417d\" />|<img width=\"1536\" height=\"943\" alt=\"image-20261003000140-nndsazz\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/604eb503-e78e-415b-8805-dc80e5cdd983\" />|\r\n|[`InspectorDock::_save_resource` when save as](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7cfa294a0b81bed7986be04a848cc1832a3f083/editor/docks/inspector_dock.cpp#L281)|<img width=\"1639\" height=\"943\" alt=\"image-20261003002020-cgldatu\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9b4a990-0a37-47ac-9d0a-cc6cd4bc26bf\" />|<img width=\"1536\" height=\"943\" alt=\"image-20261003002631-rgilbvn\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/401cd831-f36f-4096-9934-3b2315431f8c\" />|\r\n|[`ThemeEditor::_theme_save_button_cbk`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7cfa294a0b81bed7986be04a848cc1832a3f083/editor/scene/gui/theme_editor_plugin.cpp#L3954)|<img width=\"1639\" height=\"943\" alt=\"image-20261003002059-r8t4yy1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ad72ce6-c1ce-4b24-acc1-932b79beabb8\" />|<img width=\"1536\" height=\"943\" alt=\"image-20261003000252-ikpdkai\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5563a9fe-8bef-4e62-ab07-8582813fac8c\" />|\r\n|[`DocumentEditorContainer::_menu_option` `FILE_MENU_SAVE_AS`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7cfa294a0b81bed7986be04a848cc1832a3f083/editor/script/script_editor_plugin.cpp#L2012)|<img width=\"1639\" height=\"943\" alt=\"image-20261003001637-2xni9nl\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a73c81b-5bfe-41af-90a5-8c4264e939b1\" />|<img width=\"1536\" height=\"943\" alt=\"image-20261003000216-bxi0sfc\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa9af46b-a3d6-4d40-b322-97590cdb56d3\" />|\r\n|[`EditorNode::save_resource`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7cfa294a0b81bed7986be04a848cc1832a3f083/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1863)[ when imported](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e7cfa294a0b81bed7986be04a848cc1832a3f083/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1863)|don't know how to repro||","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124095/reactions","total_c